# Adapted from Polestar's guide forever/alliance/50-60/05-silithus (GPL-3.0, github.com/fitzforge/polestar, tag v0.3.4).
# Changes: guide id, title, folder, next guide, group notes. Quest steps kept as Polestar wrote them,
# except where a comment marked "Groupe Alliance" says otherwise.
guide groupe-alliance/31-silithus
title Group 29 · Eastern Plaguelands
folder Group Alliance
faction Alliance
levels 58-58
zone Silithus
next groupe-alliance/32-silithus-fin

# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Left out: Taking Back Silithus (8275).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ratchet

step Ratchet
  note Everyone at their own pace: what you already did ticks itself, the guide picks up where you are. Playing together? Group XP is best within 4 levels.
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly from Marshal's Refuge to Ratchet.
  fly "Ratchet"
  sethome "Ratchet"
  turnin 4502                         -- Liv Rizzlefix, inside
  collect 10556 quest 3444.1 @62.5,38.5 map 1413 -- Stone Circle

step Boat to Booty Bay
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.4,38.5 "Boat to Booty Bay"

step Fly to Stormwind
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 27.5,77.7 "Booty Bay flight master"
  fly "Stormwind"
  zone Stormwind City

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Ironforge
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  zone Ironforge
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge.
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: the nine cloth donation quests (Clavicus Knavingham, Bubulo Acerbus,
# Mistina Steelshield) are no longer taken here but on Group 30's visit to the same NPCs, where they
# are handed in: they held nine log slots for a whole guide (39 of 40 in a group taking everything).
step Stormwind City
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Take the boat from Ratchet to Booty Bay and fly to Stormwind.
  turnin 5022                         -- Royal Factor Bathrilor
  accept 5048
  turnin 5048                         -- Ol' Emma, who walks the canals
  accept 5050                         -- For Janice Felstone: keep it

step Stormwind Keep
  accept 6182                         -- Highlord Bolvar Fordragon
  turnin 6182                         -- Master Mathias Shaw, in SI:7
  accept 6183
  turnin 6183
  accept 6184                         -- Flint Shadowmore at Chillwind Camp: keep it

step Tram to Ironforge
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 64.5,7.5 "Tram to Ironforge"

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 4512                         -- Laris Geardawdle
  accept 4513                         -- Its jars are filled on the next Un'Goro visit
  turnin 3701                         -- Royal Historian Archesonus
  accept 7261                         -- Lieutenant Rotimer

step Fly to Light's Hope Chapel
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Light's Hope Chapel"
  zone Eastern Plaguelands

step Light's Hope Chapel
  turnin 5181                         -- Carlin Redpath

step Light's Hope Chapel
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Ride on north to Chillwind Camp and fly to Light's Hope Chapel.
  turnin 5168                         -- Carlin Redpath
  accept 5206

# Groupe Alliance (0.9.9): second tip, the Fetid Skulls are no quest objective.
step Scourge Champions
  tip Scourge Champions (59) roam the Noxious Glade, north of Light's Hope Chapel. Pass Carlin's Mystic Crystal over each one you kill: the skulls that resonate are the ones he wants. Pull them one at a time.
  tip The Champions drop Fetid Skulls, which the game does not count: their tooltip shows nothing. Right-click the Mystic Crystal in the bags with a skull there: the skull becomes a Resonating Skull or crumbles to Bone Dust. The skull line of this step counts the Resonating Skulls.
  kill 8529 optional                  -- Scourge Champion
  collect 13155 quest 5206.1 @81.5,44.0 -- Resonating Skull, from the Scourge Champions

step Light's Hope Chapel
  turnin 5206                         -- Carlin Redpath
  accept 5941                         -- Chromie in Andorhal: keep it

step Infiltrator Hameya
  tip Ride north to the Plaguewood's north-eastern edge.
  tip Careful: The trolls along the path to Zul'Mashar are level 57-59. They run away at low health and call for help, so they often bring adds with them.
  collect 15767 quest 6024.1          -- Hameya's Key

step The Undercroft
  tip Ride south-west to the Undercroft. The mound of dirt lies inside. Mercutio Filthgorger is elite: grouping up is advised.
  tip Careful: About four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot.
  turnin 6024                         -- Mound of Dirt
  collect 14613 quest 5781.1 optional -- Taelan's Hammer, from Mercutio Filthgorger